    {
      "id": 200,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        -600,
        0
      ],
      "size": [
        540,
        760
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 0,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "What to download / where to put it",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# 360 panorama of a place from one photo - MiniMax H3 image + 360 LoRA + Klein seam repair\n\nThe panorama is generated at 2:1 with the 360 LoRA, then the left/right seam (behind the camera) is repaired with\nFLUX.2 Klein: the image is turned by 180 degrees, the back is painted green and regenerated, and only that band is\npasted back. Two images are saved: the raw panorama and the repaired one.\n\n## Models (in `ComfyUI/models/`)\n| File | Folder |\n|---|---|\n| minimax_h3_image_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors | `diffusion_models/` |\n| qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors | `text_encoders/` |\n| minimax_h3_image_vae_fp16.safetensors | `vae/` |\n| [h3-360-equirect-lora-v1.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/rehan-fal/minimax-h3-360-equirect-lora/blob/main/h3-360-equirect-lora-v1.safetensors) | `loras/` |\n| [flux-2-klein-9b-fp8.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-9b-fp8/blob/main/flux-2-klein-9b-fp8.safetensors) | `diffusion_models/` |\n| [qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Flux-2-Klein-9B/blob/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors) | `text_encoders/` |\n| [flux2-vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Flux-2-Klein-9B/blob/main/split_files/vae/flux2-vae.safetensors) | `vae/` |\n| [flux-2-klein-9B-360-erp-outpaint-lora_V1.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/nomadoor/flux-2-klein-9B-360-erp-outpaint-lora/blob/main/flux-2-klein-9B-360-erp-outpaint-lora_V1.safetensors) | `loras/` |\n\nAny subfolder of `loras/` works: just select the file in the LoRA node.\n\n## Custom nodes (in `ComfyUI/custom_nodes/`)\n- **ComfyUI-PerspToERP** (180 degree roll): https://github.com/shisa84/ComfyUI-PerspToERP\n- **ComfyUI-KJNodes** (soft mask edge): https://github.com/kijai/ComfyUI-KJNodes\n\n## Settings to adapt\n- **Reference photo** and **Scene** (what the photo shows, then ahead / right / behind / left / overhead).\n- **Seam repair texts**: Style only (no furniture words) and Back (\"The green area is ...\").\n- Size 1024x512 (2:1), 360 LoRA 0.75. H3 image: 6 steps, cfg 1.\n- Tested on the seaside living room: raw seam correlation -0.2 to 0.65, after repair 0.84 to 0.97.\n"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
